"kun"}]},{"text":"துறைவனைப்","tr":"tuṟaivaṉaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வனைப்","tr":"vaṉaip"}]}],[{"text":"பெரிய","tr":"periya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரி","tr":"peri"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"கூறி","tr":"kūṟi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றி","tr":"ṟi"}]},{"text":"யாயறிந்","tr":"yāyaṟin","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யறிந்","tr":"yaṟin"}]},{"text":"தனளே","tr":"taṉaḷē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அது","parts":[{"text":"அது","lemma":"atu","gloss":"that"}],"gloss":"that"},{"surface":"வரலன்மையோ","parts":[{"text":"வரல்","lemma":"varal","gloss":"coming"},{"text":"அன்மை","lemma":"aṉmai","gloss":"not being"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"is it not coming?"},{"surface":"அரிதே","parts":[{"text":"அரிது","lemma":"aritu","gloss":"rare"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is rare indeed"},{"surface":"அவன்மார்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"avaṉ","gloss":"he"},{"text":"மார்","lemma":"mār","gloss":"honorific plural suffix"}],"gloss":"he"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புறுக","parts":[{"text":"புறுக","lemma":"puṟutal","gloss":"let us embrace"}],"gloss":"let us embrace"},{"surface":"என்ற","parts":[{"text":"என்ற","lemma":"eṉal","gloss":"that said"}],"gloss":"that said"},{"surface":"நாளே","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"day"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the day indeed"},{"surface":"குறுகி","parts":[{"text":"குறுகி","lemma":"kuṟuku","gloss":"having neared"}],"gloss":"having neared"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஈங்காகின்றே","parts":[{"text":"ஈங்கு","lemma":"īṅku","gloss":"here"},{"text":"ஆகின்றே","lemma":"ākiṉṟu","gloss":"has become"}],"gloss":"has become here"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"kāṉal","gloss":"seashore grove"}],"gloss":"seashore grove"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆடரை","parts":[{"text":"ஆடு","lemma":"āṭu","gloss":"shake"},{"text":"அரை","lemma":"arai","gloss":"tree trunk"}],"gloss":"shaking trunk"},{"surface":"புதையக்","parts":[{"text":"புதையக்","lemma":"புதையக்","gloss":"to be covered"}],"gloss":"to be covered","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கோடையிட்ட","parts":[{"text":"கோடை","lemma":"kōṭai","gloss":"west wind"},{"text":"இட்ட","lemma":"iṭu","gloss":"thrown"}],"gloss":"thrown by the west wind"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அடும்பிவர்","parts":[{"text":"அடும்பு","lemma":"aṭumpu","gloss":"hare-leaf creeper"},{"text":"இவர்","lemma":"ivar","gloss":"climb"}],"gloss":"where the adumbu creeper climbs"},{"surface":"மணற்கோடு","parts":[{"text":"மணல்","lemma":"maṇal","gloss":"sand"},{"text":"கோடு","lemma":"kōṭu","gloss":"dune"}],"gloss":"sand dune"},{"surface":"ஊர","parts":[{"text":"ஊர","lemma":"ūru","gloss":"to spread over"}],"gloss":"to spread over"},{"surface":"நெடும்பனைக்","parts":[{"text":"நெடும்பனைக்","lemma":"நெடும்பனைக்","gloss":"tall palmyra trees"}],"gloss":"tall palmyra trees","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குறியவாகுந்","parts":[{"text":"குறியவாகுந்","lemma":"குறியவாகுந்","gloss":"becoming short"}],"gloss":"becoming short","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துறைவனைப்","parts":[{"text":"துறைவனைப்","lemma":"துறைவனைப்","gloss":"the lord of the shore"}],"gloss":"the lord of the shore","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெரிய","parts":[{"text":"பெரிய","lemma":"periya","gloss":"big"}],"gloss":"big words"},{"surface":"கூறி","parts":[{"text":"கூறி","lemma":"kūṟu","gloss":"having spoken"}],"gloss":"having spoken"},{"surface":"யாயறிந்தனளே","parts":[{"text":"யாய்","lemma":"yāy","gloss":"my mother"},{"text":"அறிந்தனள்","lemma":"aṟi","gloss":"she knew"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"mother has known indeed"}]}],"literal":"That coming is it not rare? He / \"let us embrace\" said day indeed having neared / has become here, O friend! Seashore grove's / shaking trunks to be covered, west wind thrown / adumbu-creeper-climbing sand dunes spreading over, tall palmyra trees / becoming short, the lord of such a shore, / big words having spoken, mother has known indeed.","translation":"Is his coming not rare, my friend? The day he promised we would embrace has drawn near and is already here. In the seashore grove, the sand dunes thrown up by the west wind, where adumbu creepers climb, have risen so high that they cover the shaking trunks of the tall palmyra trees, making them look short. Because of the big rumors spoken about the lord of such a shore, mother has found out about our love.","modern":"தோழியே! அவர் வருவது அரிதாகிவிட்டது. 'நாம் ஒன்றுசேர்வோம்' என்று அவர் குறிப்பிட்ட நாள் நெருங்கி இப்போது வந்துவிட்டது. கடற்கரைச் சோலையிலே, அசையும் அடிமரங்கள் மறையும்படி கோடைக்காற்று வீசி எறிந்த, அடும்புக்கொடிகள் படர்ந்த மணல்மேடுகள் உயரமாய் வளர, நெடிய பனைமரங்கள் குட்டையாகத் தோன்றும் கடற்கரைத் தலைவனைப் பற்றிப் பலரும் அலர் தூற்றியதால், என் தாய் நம் காதலை அறிந்துவிட்டாள்.","explanation":"The friend (tōḻi) is speaking to the heroine (talaivi) about the hero's delay and the rising gossip in the village. She points out that the day the hero promised to return and marry her has already arrived, yet he is not here. Meanwhile, the mother has found out about their secret relationship due to the loud rumors spreading among the villagers. The poem uses a vivid Neytal (seashore) image where the tall palmyra trees are buried by wind-blown sand dunes, making them appear short. This serves as an implicit metaphor (uḷḷuṟai): just as the tall trees are hidden by the rising sand, the hero's noble reputation and their secret love are being overwhelmed and exposed by the rising tide of public gossip.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.